452
01:27:08,822 --> 01:27:09,982
¡Carajo!

453
01:27:22,018 --> 01:27:24,684
TRIPAS ESTILO CAEN

454
01:27:26,260 --> 01:27:28,125
SESOS MARINADOS

455
01:27:30,584 --> 01:27:32,650
